          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Karnataka Fast-Tracks Drone Testing Facility Near Bengaluru to Lead India's Drone Economy",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "The Karnataka government is accelerating development of a dedicated drone testing facility near Bengaluru as part of its strategy to become the anchor state in India's rapidly growing drone economy. The facility is intended to provide a certified environment for drone manufacturers, startups, and defence-adjacent companies to test unmanned aerial systems without navigating the complexities of airspace permissions. Karnataka already hosts a significant concentration of drone and aerospace startups and is competing with states like Uttar Pradesh and Telangana for leadership in the sector.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/05/karnataka-drone-testing-facility-bengaluru-drone-economy",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
              "url": "https://theaichronicle.com",
              "logo": {
